# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libclc
_lockname=llvm
pkgver=20.1.8
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="OpenCL C library, as SPIR-V for Mesa's precompiled GPU kernels (Intel)"
arch=(any)
url="https://libclc.llvm.org/"
license=(Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception)
source=("https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/releases/download/llvmorg-$pkgver/llvm-project-$pkgver.src.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('6898f963c8e938981e6c4a302e83ec5beb4630147c7311183cf61069af16333d')

build() {
    # only the SPIR-V forms Mesa uses
    cmake -S llvm-project-$pkgver.src/libclc -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \
        -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DLLVM_DIR=/usr/lib/cmake/llvm \
        -DLIBCLC_TARGETS_TO_BUILD="spirv-mesa3d-;spirv64-mesa3d-"
    ninja -C build
}

package() {
    DESTDIR="$pkgdir" ninja -C build install
}
